    "body": "As far as I can tell nobody actually implements this section of the spec at all. (Or the microdata one nearby.)\n\nI tried dragging the selection at http://jsbin.com/recamidedi/edit?html,console,output and it didn't give any URL values.\n\nDoes anyone know if I'm testing wrong? Or should we gut this section in general?\n",
