    "created_at": "2016-05-23T10:56:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-23T10:56:55Z",
    "body": "> I'm not sure why any URL parsing needs to take place here at all. If they are A elements with a HREF the UA presumably already at some point parsed their URLs?\n\nNot necessarily. It's only parsed when you hover a link and the browser shows the URL in the UI, or if a script accesses `.href` getter, or the link is followed, etc. Also with base URL changes the last time it was parsed might be the \"old\" URL. (See https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/798 for a discussion for a similar case.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
